   k[ 0] vs k[ 4]: max |corr| over 48x48 bit pairs = 0.00950
   k[ 0] vs k[ 8]: max |corr| over 48x48 bit pairs = 0.00706
   k[ 0] vs k[15]: max |corr| over 48x48 bit pairs = 0.00752
   k[ 7] vs k[ 8]: max |corr| over 48x48 bit pairs = 0.00779
   k[14] vs k[15]: max |corr| over 48x48 bit pairs = 0.00894
   [PASS] no subkey bit pair correlates beyond 0.01108   worst 0.00950 at (0, 4, 19, 24)

